Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: pinctrl: samsung: describe GPIO hog children

Upstream-Status: Pending

Samsung pin banks are GPIO controllers and participate in the standard
gpiolib OF hog scan. Permit their existing GPIO hog child nodes using the
same naming convention as other GPIO controller bindings. Each accepted
child must declare gpio-hog; the common GPIO hog schema validates its
direction, GPIO specifier and line name.

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pinctrl/samsung,pinctrl-gpio-bank.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pinctrl/samsung,pinctrl-gpio-bank.yaml
@@ -45,6 +45,13 @@
     minItems: 1
     maxItems: 8

+patternProperties:
+  "^.+-hog(-[0-9]+)?$":
+    type: object
+
+    required:
+      - gpio-hog
+
 required:
   - '#gpio-cells'
   - gpio-controller
